# Never commit game files or binaries — this project stores only files we create.
# Game executables, assets, and archives
*.exe
*.dll
*.bin
# Unreal Engine 1 package formats (original game content)
*.u
*.unr
*.utx
*.uax
*.umx
*.usm
*.uxx
*.upak
# Extracted or dumped memory / process data
*.dmp
*.dump
*.raw
# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.log

# ...but recon evidence logs are DERIVED DATA, not scratch run logs. The blanket
# `*.log` above silently swallowed this project's 2026-09-08 ABI evidence — the
# before/after `check-abi` logs, which ARE the proof the loader error is fixed.
# `git add` skipped them without complaint, exactly as it did for doom-2016-vr,
# the-evil-within-vr and enslaved-vr on 2026-08-31. Caught here only because the
# staged numstat was read before committing. Negate the rule for recon/.
!dev-archive/recon/**/*.log
!recon/**/*.log
